["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasTest", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Every `to` Element is a test artifact for the `from` Element (`from` hasTest `to`), during a LifecycleScopeType period.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
